 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-id2046909\" class=\"interactive\" data-label=\"\">\n<h2 class=\"os-title\" data-type=\"title\">\n  <span class=\"os-title-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"os-note-body\">\n<h3 data-type=\"title\" class=\"os-subtitle\">\n  <span class=\"os-subtitle-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h3> \n<span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-id2890478\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\"> <img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20241024.164013/resources/f781af36d278967c78ca098e9c85e42e2f0424b0\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"> </span> <p id=\"fs-id2694589\">Click through the steps of this <a href=\"https://openstaxcollege.org/l/prokary_protein\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">PBS interactive</a> to see protein synthesis in action.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
